## Keeping these guides honest

If a guide disagrees with the API, the API is right and the guide is stale. A change to a route moves its
owner guide's *Last checked against the code* line in the same branch (`check-fe-guides.py`), and
`/book:check-guides` checks every guide against the contracts, the source and the ledgers before a QA build
or a publish. A new guide starts from [`_template.md`](_template.md).
